# ground20: a door with nothing below it (ideal inputs). Sides: 3 pull-type sticky pistons per
# side (x -2 / x 4). Middle column: elevator A (1,4) on B (1,5) on D (1,6), all sticky facing
# down: A pulls T, C and M up out of the opening (M from three heights); P_T (-1,3) parks T at
# (0,3), P_C (3,3) parks C at (2,3), M ends at (1,3). Every action is a 2 gt pulse (pull-type
# with a gap in front, push-and-spit otherwise), one every 6 ticks.
# Power cells: A at height 4/3/2: (1,4,-1)/(1,3,-1)/(1,2,-1); B at 5/4: (1,5,1)/(1,4,1);
# D: (1,6,1); P_T: (-1,4,0); P_C: (3,4,0); sides: (-3,y,0) and (5,y,0).
design designs/piston-door-3x3/tracks/shapes/bases/ground20.txt
# ---- open ----
# sides out, A pulls T up to (1,3)
open 0 set -3 0 0 minecraft:redstone_block
open 0 set -3 1 0 minecraft:redstone_block
open 0 set -3 2 0 minecraft:redstone_block
open 0 set 5 0 0 minecraft:redstone_block
open 0 set 5 1 0 minecraft:redstone_block
open 0 set 5 2 0 minecraft:redstone_block
open 0 set 1 4 -1 minecraft:redstone_block
open 2 clear -3 0 0
open 2 clear -3 1 0
open 2 clear -3 2 0
open 2 clear 5 0 0
open 2 clear 5 1 0
open 2 clear 5 2 0
open 2 clear 1 4 -1
# P_T parks T at (0,3)
open 6 set -1 4 0 minecraft:redstone_block
open 8 clear -1 4 0
# B pushes A down to (1,3) (spit)
open 12 set 1 5 1 minecraft:redstone_block
open 14 clear 1 5 1
# A (height 3) pulls C up to (1,2)
open 18 set 1 3 -1 minecraft:redstone_block
open 20 clear 1 3 -1
# B pulls A back up to (1,4)
open 24 set 1 5 1 minecraft:redstone_block
open 26 clear 1 5 1
# A pulls C up to (1,3)
open 30 set 1 4 -1 minecraft:redstone_block
open 32 clear 1 4 -1
# P_C parks C at (2,3)
open 36 set 3 4 0 minecraft:redstone_block
open 38 clear 3 4 0
# D pushes B and A down (B (1,4), A (1,3))
open 42 set 1 6 1 minecraft:redstone_block
open 44 clear 1 6 1
# B (height 4) pushes A down to (1,2)
open 48 set 1 4 1 minecraft:redstone_block
open 50 clear 1 4 1
# A (height 2) pulls M up to (1,1)
open 54 set 1 2 -1 minecraft:redstone_block
open 56 clear 1 2 -1
# B pulls A up to (1,3)
open 60 set 1 4 1 minecraft:redstone_block
open 62 clear 1 4 1
# A (height 3) pulls M up to (1,2)
open 66 set 1 3 -1 minecraft:redstone_block
open 68 clear 1 3 -1
# D pulls B up to (1,5)
open 72 set 1 6 1 minecraft:redstone_block
open 74 clear 1 6 1
# B pulls A up to (1,4)
open 78 set 1 5 1 minecraft:redstone_block
open 80 clear 1 5 1
# A pulls M up to (1,3): open
open 84 set 1 4 -1 minecraft:redstone_block
open 86 clear 1 4 -1
# ---- close ----
